%% Sequence: status polling of the Web UI (GET /api/health, GET /api/stats) and system startup
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DC as docker compose
    participant DI as dataset-init
    participant O as ollama
    participant S as search-server (main)
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant HC as HealthController
    participant CP as controlPool
    participant OC as OllamaClient
    participant ST as StatsController

    DC->>DI: start (generate_dataset.py)
    DI->>DI: skip if metadata.json matches, else generate 20 000 docs
    DI-->>DC: exit 0 (service_completed_successfully)
    DC->>O: start (healthcheck: ollama list)
    DC->>S: start (after dataset-init)
    S->>S: register routes, buildIndexAsync(INDEX_THREADS)
    Note over S: /api/search returns 503 index_not_ready<br/>until the first build is published

    loop every 5 s
        UI->>HC: GET /api/health
        HC->>CP: post(check)
        CP->>OC: isAvailable()
        alt cache older than OLLAMA_HEALTH_TTL_SEC
            OC->>O: GET /api/tags (timeout 2 s)
            O-->>OC: models list → is qwen2.5:3b present?
        end
        OC-->>CP: true / false
        CP-->>UI: 200 {"status":"ok","ollama":true,"index_ready":true,"model":"qwen2.5:3b"}
        UI->>ST: GET /api/stats
        ST-->>UI: 200 {"documents":20000,"index_build_time_ms":...,"threads_used":8,...}
    end
